L000281	    \left(\tilde{\omega}_m, \tilde{u}_m e^{im\phi}, \tilde{v}_m e^{im\phi}\right),
L000282	\end{align}
L000283	where $\tilde{u}_m$ and $\tilde{v}_m$ represent the quasiparticle amplitudes in the transversal $(r,z)$ directions.
